<title>UK: UK 10-year gilt auction covered 2.69 times.</title>
<headline>UK 10-year gilt auction covered 2.69 times.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by the Bank of England</p>
<p>ISSUER: H M Treasury</p>
<p>MATURITY: 2006</p>
<p>COUPON: 7.5 percent</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 7.90 percent</p>
<p>BID AMOUNT/COVER: 6,727.7 million stg/2.690 times</p>
<p>LOWEST ACCEPTED PRICE: 97.04</p>
<p>PCT ALLOCATED AT LOWEST PRICE: 93.0 percent</p>
<p>NOTE: The yield tail was one basis point, the price tail 1/32.</p>
</text>
